  "description": "As a third-year developer, Lee Dan-Bi’s life motto was simple. Don’t covet the world beyond your own little pond; be content with reality. That’s why she was able to give up on a one-sided crush that was beyond her reach…\n\nToday’s Horoscope - The start of the week: Watch out for a sudden tidal wave!\n\nOne morning that began with an unsettling horoscope, the newly appointed team leader… her first love from school days? And that massive tidal wave crashes head-on into Dan-Bi’s simple life! \n\n *“I don’t get it. The Lee Dan-Bi I know likes me.”*\n\nFaced with that dizzying sense of strangeness, her heart began to race wildly once again.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
